       --ff     Normally, ee22uunnddoo will check the file system superblock  to  make
              sure  the  undo  log matches with the file system on the device.
              If they do not match, ee22uunnddoo will refuse to apply the  undo  log
              as a safety mechanism.  The --ff option disables this safety mech‐
              anism.

